.Dd November 15, 2026
.Dt BEEP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm beep
.Nd generate a tone on the audio: scheme
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl f Ar hz
.Op Fl d Ar ms
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
generates a sine tone at 48 kHz stereo and plays it through
.Dv audio:out0 .
The default is 440 Hz for one second.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl f Ar hz , Fl -frequency Ar hz
Tone frequency, 1 to 20000 Hz.
.It Fl d Ar ms , Fl -duration-ms Ar ms
Duration in milliseconds, 1 to 60000.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
The tone was played.
.It 1
The audio server returned an error.
.It 2
Usage error or an out-of-range value.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr play 1 ,
.Xr mixer 1 ,
.Xr audiod 8
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
utility first appeared in RavenBSD 0.1.
